&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Instabase, we&#39;re passionate about democratizing access to cutting-edge AI innovation to enable any organization to solve previously unsolvable unstructured data problems in their industry.&amp;nbsp; With customers representing some of the largest and most complex organizations in the world, and investors like Greylock, Andreessen Horowitz, and Index Ventures, our market opportunity is near infinite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Instabase offers a consumption-based pricing model where customers can pay only for what they use, aligning directly with the value our products deliver. It empowers our clients to explore our AI Hub platform features extensively, enabling them to uncover crucial business insights. This customer-centric model allows Instabase to glean insights from diverse use cases and behaviors, ensuring we deliver top-tier solutions that provide unmatched advantages for everyday business operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With offices in San Francisco and Bengaluru, Instabase is a truly global company. We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;people-first&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve built a fearlessly experimental, endlessly curious, customer obsessed team who work together and help organizations around the world turn their unstructured data into insights&amp;nbsp;instantly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About SuperApp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SuperApp is the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI collaboration super app&lt;/strong&gt;. We bring real-time group messaging, leading AI models, and collaborative content creation into one shared workspace—keeping conversations, files, decisions, feedback, and finished work connected from the first prompt to the final deliverable. Our principles include being multiplayer by default, finishing the work, preserving freedom of choice, and making trust visible. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://superapp.chat/about/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;superapp.chat&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SuperApp is looking for an exceptional&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Assistant to the CEO&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to help our CEO and leadership team operate with focus, speed, and precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-trust, high-impact position for someone who combines outstanding judgment with operational rigor. You will manage a complex executive calendar, coordinate critical meetings and travel, prepare the CEO for important decisions, and ensure priorities move forward without losing context or momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate anticipates needs, communicates clearly, handles sensitive information with discretion, and remains composed as priorities evolve. You should be equally comfortable managing the details of a demanding schedule and understanding the broader business context behind them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Executive support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and strategically manage the CEO’s calendar, protecting time for the company’s highest-priority work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal and external meetings across employees, customers, partners, investors, candidates, and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate scheduling conflicts, resolve them proactively, and ensure the CEO is prepared for every engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage domestic and international travel, including detailed itineraries, accommodations, transportation, and last-minute changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and process expenses, invoices, approvals, and related administrative work accurately and promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle confidential company, personnel, customer, and financial information with exceptional discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Meeting and communication management&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop meeting agendas, briefing materials, background notes, and follow-up documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the CEO has the necessary context, objectives, and materials before important meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture decisions, commitments, owners, and deadlines, then follow through to ensure action items are completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and edit correspondence, internal announcements, presentations, and other executive communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a thoughtful and professional point of contact for people engaging with the CEO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage inbound requests and help distinguish urgent matters from those that can be delegated or handled asynchronously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership operations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the operating cadence of the CEO and executive team, including leadership meetings, company-wide meetings, planning sessions, and offsites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility into the CEO’s priorities and help ensure time and attention remain aligned with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across teams to gather information, resolve dependencies, and keep important initiatives moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create lightweight systems and processes that improve executive effectiveness and organizational follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support board, investor, recruiting, customer, and partner activities as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan executive dinners, team events, leadership offsites, and other important gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on special projects that require sound judgment, resourcefulness, and confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of experience supporting a CEO, founder, C-suite executive, or senior leader in a fast-moving organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a technology company, high-growth startup, venture-backed business, or similarly demanding environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional calendar management, prioritization, organization, and project-coordination skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, with meticulous attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment and the ability to make thoughtful decisions with incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive working style—you anticipate needs, identify risks, and act before being asked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage competing priorities while remaining calm, responsive, and solutions-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence and the ability to work effectively with employees and external stakeholders at every level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unquestionable integrity and discretion when handling confidential or sensitive matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with modern workplace, communication, scheduling, and productivity tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI and a willingness to use AI tools thoughtfully to improve executive and organizational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work regularly in person in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco, California&lt;/strong&gt;, with flexibility outside standard business hours when important matters arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel occasionally, including supporting domestic or international executive travel when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During your first year, success will mean:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The CEO’s time is consistently aligned with the company’s most important priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetings begin with clear objectives and end with documented decisions, owners, and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Important commitments are tracked and completed without repeated follow-up from the CEO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication between the CEO, leadership team, and external stakeholders is timely and effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel, events, and executive logistics are handled smoothly, including when plans change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are viewed as a trusted partner who improves the effectiveness of both the CEO and the broader organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: The base salary range for this role is $120,000 to $145,000 + bonus, equity, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://instabase.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/2023-Instabase-Benefits-Guide-%E2%80%94-US.pdf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;benefits. The actual pay may vary based on factors such as location, experience, and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;US Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/strong&gt;: Because life is better when you actually live it!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Coverage&lt;/strong&gt;: Top-notch medical, dental, and vision insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;401(k) with Matching&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve got your back for a secure future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Parental Leave &amp;amp; Fertility Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: Supporting you in growing your family, your way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Therapy Sessions Covered&lt;/strong&gt;: Mental health matters— 10 free sessions through Samata Health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Wellness Stipend&lt;/strong&gt;: For gym memberships, fitness tech, or whatever keeps you thriving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Lunch on Us&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a lunch credit when you&#39;re in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Li-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Instabase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Research shows that in order to apply for a job, women feel they need to meet 100% of the criteria while men usually apply after meeting about 60%. Regardless of how you identify, if you believe you can do the job and are a good match, we encourage you to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Instabase, we&#39;re passionate about democratizing access to cutting-edge AI innovation to enable any organization to solve previously unsolvable unstructured data problems in their industry.&amp;nbsp; With customers representing some of the largest and most complex organizations in the world, and investors like Greylock, Andreessen Horowitz, and Index Ventures, our market opportunity is near infinite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Instabase offers a consumption-based pricing model where customers can pay only for what they use, aligning directly with the value our products deliver. It empowers our clients to explore our AI Hub platform features extensively, enabling them to uncover crucial business insights. This customer-centric model allows Instabase to glean insights from diverse use cases and behaviors, ensuring we deliver top-tier solutions that provide unmatched advantages for everyday business operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With offices in San Francisco and Bengaluru, Instabase is a truly global company. We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;people-first&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve built a fearlessly experimental, endlessly curious, customer obsessed team who work together and help organizations around the world turn their unstructured data into insights&amp;nbsp;instantly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are revolutionizing how businesses solve their most complex problems. As a Fullstack Software Engineer in our Core Services team, you’ll design, build, and optimize the core systems and management platforms that power the Instabase platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role for a “Product-minded Engineer.” In our Core Services team, we treat our platform as a product. Because we operate with a lean team, you will have end-to-end ownership: from writing Product Requirement Documents (PRDs) and building the high-performance backend services and scalable infrastructure that support them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Full Stack Development:&lt;/strong&gt; You will function as a product-minded engineer for our internal platform. This involves architecting secure infrastructure (Kubernetes, Docker) and backend services (Go, Python, PostgresDB), while also building the frontend interfaces (React, TS) to support features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Developer Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Create the internal platforms and dashboards that improve developer velocity, reliability, and observability across the entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical leader who mentors junior engineers, contributes to the entire infrastructure codebase, and identifies root causes for critical system issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Education:&lt;/strong&gt; BS, MS, or PhD in Computer Science, or equivalent experience in a technical field such as Physics or Mathematics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of professional software development experience with a strong foundation in CS fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Backend Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in Go and Python, with a deep understanding of building scalable backend services and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Frontend Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience with React, TypeScript, and JavaScript for building complex, data-rich web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Infrastructure &amp;amp; Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with Docker, Kubernetes, and cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP, or Azure). Strong experience with relational databases, specifically PostgresDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Product Thinking &amp;amp; UI Design:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable functioning as your own PM and Designer and write technical specs (PRDs) to define how users interact with infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills to represent technical and product decisions to the wider engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React Native for mobile or cross-platform applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a startup environment where you handled multi-functional responsibilities (Dev, PM, and Design).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: The base salary range for this role is $190,000 to $205,000 + bonus, equity and US benefits. The actual pay may vary based on factors such as location, experience and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;US Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/strong&gt;: Because life is better when you actually live it!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Coverage&lt;/strong&gt;: Top-notch medical, dental, and vision insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;401(k) with Matching&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve got your back for a secure future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Parental Leave &amp;amp; Fertility Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: Supporting you in growing your family, your way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Therapy Sessions Covered&lt;/strong&gt;: Mental health matters— 10 free sessions through Samata Health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Wellness Stipend&lt;/strong&gt;: For gym memberships, fitness tech, or whatever keeps you thriving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Lunch on Us&lt;/strong&gt;: Enjoy a lunch credit when you&#39;re in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Instabase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, or disability status. Research shows that in order to apply for a job, women feel they need to meet 100% of the criteria while men usually apply after meeting about 60%. Regardless of how you identify, if you believe you can do the job and are a good match, we encourage you to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Instabase, we&#39;re passionate about democratizing access to cutting-edge AI innovation to enable any organization to solve previously unsolvable unstructured data problems in their industry.&amp;nbsp; With customers representing some of the largest and most complex organizations in the world, and investors like Greylock, Andreessen Horowitz, and Index Ventures, our market opportunity is near infinite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Instabase offers a consumption-based pricing model where customers can pay only for what they use, aligning directly with the value our products deliver. It empowers our clients to explore our AI Hub platform features extensively, enabling them to uncover crucial business insights. This customer-centric model allows Instabase to glean insights from diverse use cases and behaviors, ensuring we deliver top-tier solutions that provide unmatched advantages for everyday business operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;With offices in San Francisco and Bengaluru, Instabase is a truly global company. We are&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;people-first&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve built a fearlessly experimental, endlessly curious, customer obsessed team who work together and help organizations around the world turn their unstructured data into insights&amp;nbsp;instantly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instabase’s Customer Engagement team partners with leading global organizations to deliver measurable, transformative business outcomes using our AI platform. As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Customer Engagement Manager (L5) specializing in our Insurance Vertical&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own our relationships with our most strategic and complex US insurance carriers end-to-end. You will act as the bridge between legacy insurance operations and our cutting-edge AI platform, leading delivery programs that fundamentally transform how carriers process unstructured data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role goes far beyond project delivery — you will act as a senior trusted advisor, strategic business consultant, and organizational change-leader. You will combine a deep understanding of customer operational bottlenecks with the cutting-edge technical capabilities of our AI platform to guide customers through major digital transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborating closely with Solution Engineering, Product, and Sales leadership, you will secure the long-term commercial health of our accounts, directly influence the Instabase product roadmap, and help mentor and scale our growing US Customer Engagement practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Technical Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead execution and governance for our most complex, high-value AI implementation programs from scoping to deployment, ensuring they deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Retention and Accelerate Renewals:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Sales, Account Management, and Customer Success executives to safeguard recurring revenue, proactively manage account health, mitigate churn risk, and secure multi-year renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Value Realization &amp;amp; Continuous Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with enterprise business sponsors post-go-live to define, track, and report on key business value metrics (ROI, cost reduction, throughput) to ensure deep platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish Senior Executive Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and lead Quarterly and Executive Business Reviews (QBRs/EBRs) with C-suite and VP-level stakeholders, aligning Instabase’s platform capabilities with their overarching corporate goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactively Unlock Expansion Opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an enterprise partner to identify new departments, use cases, and business processes that can be transformed by Instabase, driving upsell pipeline in collaboration with Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence Product Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Synthesize and champion critical product feedback, feature requests, and delivery challenges from our largest US accounts, partnering directly with Product and Engineering leadership to help steer the Instabase roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and Develop the Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a mentor to mid-level and associate CEMs, model delivery best practices, and contribute to scaling team templates, playbooks, and strategic methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage High Ambiguity and Risk:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively navigate complex enterprise politics, manage escalations gracefully, and coordinate cross-functional resolution for technical, operational, or alignment risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–8+ years of experience working directly within the insurance industry (e.g., P&amp;amp;C, Life, Commercial, reinsurance, or brokerage) or as a lead consultant/program manager driving digital transformation for tier-1 insurance carriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong understanding of core insurance operations&lt;/strong&gt;, such as claims processing, underwriting, policy administration, or compliance. You understand the operational pain points of document-heavy manual workflows and how automation directly impacts key insurance metrics (e.g., combined ratios, loss adjustment expenses, and cycle times).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorous Program &amp;amp; Project Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven track record of leading complex, multi-stakeholder delivery engagements, project governance, risk management, and timeline execution. You are highly comfortable coordinating cross-functional teams to deliver operational changes in legacy corporate environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Gravitas &amp;amp; Relationship Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, with a proven track record of acting as a &quot;trusted advisor&quot; to senior insurance leaders (VPs, COOs, Heads of Claims/Underwriting) and aligning various business and IT stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Technical Curiosity&lt;/strong&gt; (We’ll Teach You the Tech!): You do not need a background in software engineering, AI, or computer science. We will fully train you on the Instabase platform. However, you must have strong analytical and logical aptitude, and feel comfortable learning how software integrations, data structures, and automation platforms map to operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Driven Commercial Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience in post-implementation value tracking (e.g., defining ROI, throughput gains, and cost-of-service reductions) to ensure deep organizational adoption and identify new operational areas that can benefit from automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience in Legacy Environments:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly collaborative, self-motivated, and energized by navigating the complex IT landscapes, regulatory requirements, and change-management challenges typical of major insurance enterprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: The base salary range for this role is $166,500 to $185,000 + equity, and US benefits. The actual pay may vary based on factors such as location, experience, and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/strong&gt;: Because life is better when you actually live it!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Coverage&lt;/strong&gt;: Top-notch medical, dental, and vision insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;401(k) with Matching&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve got your back for a secure future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental Leave &amp;amp; Fertility Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: Supporting you in growing your family, your way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Therapy Sessions Covered&lt;/strong&gt;: Mental health matters— 10 free sessions through Samata Health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness Stipend&lt;/strong&gt;: For gym memberships, fitness tech, or whatever keeps you thriving.&lt;/li&gt;
